1782583972243211	bones-dev	itc:v3:AWKSZJkkk5JkmZMxAAAAQatWqrq1bWwAAAE3BA		item.create	bn-3p77	{"description":".bones/.gitattributes had `events/** merge=union`, which also applied the git union merge driver to .manifest files. Manifests are single coherent snapshots (event_count/byte_len/file_hash); union-merging them duplicates key lines and from_string_repr silently parses the last value, mixing fields from two shard states and breaking the seal/verify integrity check. Fix: scope union to events/*.events and mark events/*.manifest -merge.","kind":"bug","labels":["cli"],"title":"Scope events union merge driver to *.events, not manifests"}	blake3:JER5JaW3ji3jOSYdlpnGD2SAMezF2uXXz9RAkiQlFYg
