1782587964603253	bones-dev	itc:v3:AWKSZJkkk5JkmZMxAAAAQatWqrq1bWwAAAE3CA		item.create	bn-3iwj	{"description":"ensure_bones_gitattributes (bones-cli, runs on every command) and bones_core::init() both hardcode `events/** merge=union`, which applies git union merge to .manifest files and corrupts the integrity snapshot. bn-3p77 only fixed this repo`s checked-in file; the generator would re-append the buggy line and every other project / future bn init still gets it. Fix: emit `events/*.events merge=union` + `events/*.manifest -merge`, migrate the legacy `events/** merge=union` (and bare `events merge=union`) in place so existing projects self-heal on next command. Update bones_core::init() to match.","kind":"bug","labels":["cli"],"title":"Fix .gitattributes generator to scope union to *.events + migrate"}	blake3:FHBe67be5KFYBU5_er4vhc0zt_chI0WPevka4SBjXAU
